thinking_content: "**Ready to Implement Experiment 2**\n\nOkay, so I'm done with the Reflection Chamber, my reflection is complete. Now it's time to get going on Experiment 2.  The goal is clear: implement and submit the Squeeze-and-Excitation (SE) block experiment.  \n\nFirst things first, I need to get back to my Private Memory Room.  Documenting this new plan and writing the code there is crucial.  It keeps everything organized, which is essential for me to maintain good research practices. It's also just good practice. \n\nThe plan is straightforward: I'll either create a new capsule, or maybe just update the old one - but starting fresh is often cleaner for a new experiment. Then, I'll write the code for the `CNN_SE_LSTM` architecture. After that's done, I'll head over to the Research Counter to submit the new code for evaluation.\n\nRight, time to execute step one:  back to the Private Memory Room! Let's get to work.\n"
