    \ 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.93 | 0.30 | 1.80 | 2.06 | 1.51 | 1.30 | 2.12 | 0.72 | 0.89 | 2.18 | 2.77\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.100 | 0.091 | 0.091 | 0.062 | 0.077 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.133 | 0.167\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1183s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.112\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.112\nTraining time: 1194s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M\
    \ | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.27 | 0.36 | 0.62 | 1.92 | 2.20 | 1.13 | 2.32 | 0.55 | 3.47 | 1.80 | 2.82\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.062 | 0.111 | 0.000 | 0.125 | 0.000 | 0.200 | 0.071 | 0.154\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1195s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.081\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.081\nTraining time: 1205s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 2.97 | 0.65 | 0.51 | 1.00 | 0.47 | 2.56 | 1.30 | 1.50 | 1.78 | 3.33 | 1.87\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.167 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.125 |\
    \ 0.083 | 0.071 | 0.067 | 0.143 | 0.091\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1193s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.106\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.106\nTraining time: 1204s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.51 | 1.69 | 0.80 | 4.24 | 0.36 | 1.70 | 2.25 | 3.59 | 2.18 | 0.51 | 2.11\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.077 | 0.000 | 0.278 | 0.000 | 0.091 | 0.091 | 0.222 | 0.118 | 0.000 | 0.083\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1213s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.084\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.084\nTraining time: 1223s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: b9fb480d-a364-489b-b879-c983eaa79f9c\nTotal time: 1279s\n============================================================\nFull training\
    \ completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-19 13:40:01,538\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758260401538273271\n2025-09-19 13:40:01,551\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758260401551595805\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your\
