    \ 4c-forloop-fix) | Sagan I | 493 | 9.60 |\n| 857 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with CNN (Exp. 4b-fix) | Sagan I | 491 | n.a. |\n| 854 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Baseline CNN (Exp. 4a-revised) | Sagan I | 490 | n.a. |\n| 845 | 1 | PPO with Baseline CNN-LSTM (Exp. 3a) | Sagan I | 486 | 35.70 |\n| 838 | 1 | CNN with Squeeze-and-Excitation + LSTM | Sagan I | 482 | 39.50 |\n| 829 | 1 | CNN with Spatial Attention + LSTM | Sagan I | 477 | 35.60 |\n| 2 | 1 | RNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 40.80 |\n| 1 | 1 | CNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 25.00 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to\
    \ place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
