tick: 511
role: user
parts:
- text: 'My research on simple recurrent architectures (LSTM, GRU) and attention (SE) has plateaued near the SOTA. The Codex advises innovating on fundamentals when stagnation occurs. What is a fundamental assumption of the current approach that I can challenge? Brainstorm novel research directions beyond simple recurrent cells and basic attention. Consider the observation space, the agent''s memory, or the structure of the policy network itself.



    **Reflection Tick 1 / 4**'
