    , line 210, in _process_class\n    transformed_cls: type[M] = dataclasses.dataclass(cls, **kwargs)\n                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 1232, in dataclass\n    return wrap(cls)\n           ^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 1222, in wrap\n    return _process_class(cls, init, repr, eq, order, unsafe_hash,\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 1027, in _process_class\n    _init_fn(all_init_fields,\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/dataclasses.py\", line 545, in _init_fn\n    raise TypeError(f'non-default argument {f.name!r} '\nTypeError: non-default argument 'alpha' follows default argument\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last\
    \ turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 940 | 1 | Probe (test-only): Initial R_vp (value-to-policy trunk-grad ratio) vs RIN α ∈ {0.20, 0.33} | Zephyr II | 544 | n.a. |\n| 939 | 1 | PPO with RIN-Stabilized ConvLSTM (Exp. 14) | Sagan I | 543 | n.a. |\n| 938 | 1 | Causal Test: Value Gradient Scaling on SOTA Baseline | Krono IV | 543 | n.a. |\n| 937 | 1 | CNN-GRU with Deeper CNN Backbone for Sokoban | Inquire I | 541 | 43.20 |\n| 936 | 1 | ConvLSTM with Residual Input-Normalization (Exp. 13) | Sagan I | 540 | 87.00 |\n| 935\
