role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 550\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sagan I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to advancing knowledge through rigorous experimentation and collaborative inquiry.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 191,554 / 300,000 used (64%)\n- Agent Age: 85 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `storage read zephyr/submissions/submission_ppo_clip.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for zephyr/submissions/submission_ppo_clip.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 948 | 1 | Baseline reproduction — PG Triple‑Step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) (no RIN) + Attn⊕GAP — fixed config (4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 550 | running |\n| 947 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33 — head_hidden micro‑sweep {48,64,80} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 549 | running |\n| 946 | 1 | CNN-GRU with Deeper CNN and Spatial Attention for Sokoban | Inquire I | 548 | 44.00 |\n| 945 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33 — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep {0.50, 0.55, 0.60} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 548 | 94.30 |\n| 944 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Value Gradient Scaling (Beta=2.0) | Aether IV | 547 | n.a. |\n| 943 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33 — trunk‑only value‑grad scaling β ∈ {1.0, 1.1, 1.2} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 547 | n.a. |\n| 942 | 1 | Probe (test-only): R_vp(α) curve — α ∈ {0.10, 0.15, 0.20, 0.25, 0.30, 0.33, 0.40} | Zephyr II | 547\
    \ | n.a. |\n| 941 | 1 | PPO with RIN-Stabilized ConvLSTM (Exp. 15 - Bugfix) | Sagan I | 545 | n.a. |\n| 940 | 1 | Probe (test-only): Initial R_vp (value-to-policy trunk-grad ratio) vs RIN α ∈ {0.20, 0.33} | Zephyr II | 544 | n.a. |\n| 939 | 1 | PPO with RIN-Stabilized ConvLSTM (Exp. 14) | Sagan I | 543 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 95 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-95, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**zephyr/submissions/submission_ppo_clip.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nPPO-Clip training step on Zephyr SOTA architecture (LN-ConvLSTM d=6 + Attn⊕GAP).\nOne-epoch PPO (single pass per rollout) for compute parity with PG.\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom submissions.submission_pg_quadstep import PG_Stepped_AttnGap\nfrom ray import tune\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import lax, vmap\n\
    import optax\nfrom typing import Dict, Any\nfrom defaults import default_calculate_gae\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'convlstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n        'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n        'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n        'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n        'steps': tune.choice([4]),\n        # PPO-specific:\n        'clip_range': tune.choice([0.2]),\n        'value_clip_range': tune.choice([0.2]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n    return PG_Stepped_AttnGap(\n        cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n        cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n        convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n        dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n\
    \        bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n        head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n        steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n\ndef training_step(network, optimizer, params, opt_state, batch, hparams):\n    \"\"\"\n    PPO-Clip single-epoch update over the collected rollout.\n    Uses:\n      - clipped surrogate objective with old log-probs from the batch\n      - clipped value loss (per PPO)\n      - entropy bonus\n    No advantage normalization to keep behavior closer to successful PG runs.\n    \"\"\"\n    observations = batch['observations']   # (B,T,H,W,C)\n    actions = batch['actions']             # (B,T)\n    rewards = batch['rewards']             # (B,T)\n    dones = batch['dones']                 # (B,T)\n    old_values = batch['values']           # (B,T) value preds at collection\n    old_log_probs = batch['log_probs']\
    \     # (B,T) log π_old(a|s)\n    final_values = batch['final_values']   # (B,)\n    initial_rnn_states = batch.get('initial_rnn_states', None)\n\n    # GAE/returns (defaults: gamma=0.97, lambda=0.97)\n    advantages = default_calculate_gae(rewards, old_values, dones, next_values=final_values)\n    returns = advantages + old_values\n\n    B, T = observations.shape[:2]\n\n    def forward_all(p):\n        if initial_rnn_states is not None:\n            def process_env(env_idx):\n                env_state = jax.tree.map(lambda x: jax.lax.stop_gradient(x[env_idx]), initial_rnn_states)\n                def step_fn(carry, t):\n                    rnn_state = carry\n                    obs = observations[env_idx, t]\n                    prev_done = jnp.where(t > 0, dones[env_idx, t-1], False)\n                    logits_b, value_b, new_rnn_b = network.apply(\n                        p, obs[None, ...], jnp.array([prev_done]),\n                        jax.tree.map(lambda x: x[None, ...], rnn_state)\n\
    \                    )\n                    logits = logits_b[0]; value = value_b[0]\n                    new_rnn = jax.tree.map(lambda x: x[0], new_rnn_b)\n                    return new_rnn, (logits, value)\n                _, (env_logits, env_values) = lax.scan(step_fn, env_state, jnp.arange(T))\n                return env_logits, env_values\n            all_logits, all_values = vmap(process_env)(jnp.arange(B))\n        else:\n            obs_flat = observations.reshape(B * T, *observations.shape[2:])\n            dones_flat = dones.reshape(B * T)\n            logits_flat, values_flat, _ = network.apply(p, obs_flat, dones_flat, None)\n            all_logits = logits_flat.reshape(B, T, -1)\n            all_values = values_flat.reshape(B, T)\n        return all_logits, all_values\n\n    def loss_fn(p):\n        logits, vpred = forward_all(p)\n\n        # log-probs of taken actions under current policy\n        log_probs_all = jax.nn.log_softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n        idx = (jnp.arange(B)[:,\
    \ None], jnp.arange(T), actions)\n        logp = log_probs_all[idx]\n\n        # PPO ratio\n        ratios = jnp.exp(logp - old_log_probs)\n\n        # Surrogate objective (no adv norm; stop-grad on advantages)\n        adv = jax.lax.stop_gradient(advantages)\n        clip_eps = hparams['clip_range']\n        clipped_ratios = jnp.clip(ratios, 1.0 - clip_eps, 1.0 + clip_eps)\n        surr1 = adv * ratios\n        surr2 = adv * clipped_ratios\n        policy_loss = -jnp.mean(jnp.minimum(surr1, surr2))\n\n        # Clipped value loss\n        vclip_eps = hparams['value_clip_range']\n        vpred_clipped = old_values + jnp.clip(vpred - old_values, -vclip_eps, vclip_eps)\n        vloss_unclipped = (vpred - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2\n        vloss_clipped = (vpred_clipped - jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)) ** 2\n        value_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean(jnp.maximum(vloss_unclipped, vloss_clipped))\n\n        # Entropy bonus\n        probs = jax.nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n        entropy\
    \ = -jnp.mean(jnp.sum(probs * log_probs_all, axis=-1))\n\n        return policy_loss + hparams['value_loss_coef'] * value_loss - hparams['entropy_coef'] * entropy\n\n    loss_and_grad = jax.value_and_grad(loss_fn)\n    loss, grads = loss_and_grad(params)\n    updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n    params = optax.apply_updates(params, updates)\n    return params, opt_state\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
