    \ have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 962 | 1 | Probe (test-only): PPO initial R_vp (value/policy trunk-grad ratio) vs RIN α ∈ {0.20, 0.33} | Zephyr II | 556 | running |\n| 961 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Baseline Run (Beta=1.0) | Aether IV | 554 | 23.90 |\n| 960 | 1 | CNN-GRU with Deeper CNN, Spatial Attention, and Increased Capacity for Sokoban | Inquire I | 554 | 35.00 |\n| 959 | 1 | PPO with Clipped Value Loss (Exp. 17) | Sagan I | 554 | 84.80 |\n| 958 | 1 | Probe: Representational Similarity (CKA) of Normalization Architectures | Krono IV | 554 | n.a. |\n| 957 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — fixed confirm (lr=3.5e‑4, vlc=0.55, entropy=0.01, steps=4) | Zephyr II | 554 | 94.50 |\n| 956 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Value Gradient Scaling (Beta=2.0) - Run 1 | Aether IV\
    \ | 553 | 24.00 |\n| 955 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — value_loss_coef micro‑sweep {0.50, 0.55, 0.60} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 553 | 94.80 |\n| 954 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Debugging Fix 2 (No JIT on training_step) | Aether IV | 552 | n.a. |\n| 953 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.33, head=48 — entropy micro‑fine {0.009, 0.010, 0.011} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 552 | 95.10 |\n\nPage 1 of 97 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-97, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
