    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 972 | 1 | Challenging Lineage Limits: 4-Step Recurrent Core on KronoNetV4 | Krono IV | 561 | running |\n| 971 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — α=0.20, head=80 — LR micro‑fine {3.25e‑4,3.5e‑4,3.75e‑4} (clip=0.2, vclip=0.2) — LN‑Co... | Zephyr II | 560 | running |\n| 970 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — α=0.20, head=80 — entropy micro‑fine {0.009,0.010,0.011} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 560 | running |\n| 969 | 1 | Revisiting Invalid Action Masking on SOTA KronoNetV4 | Krono IV | 559 | 89.50 |\n| 968 | 1 | Aether IV: Architecture Modification - LayerNorm in DefaultResidualCNN | Aether IV | 558 | 22.30 |\n| 967 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — RIN α=0.20 — policy clip_range micro‑fine {0.15,0.20,0.25} (value_clip=0.2) — LN‑ConvL... | Zephyr II | 558 | 94.20 |\n| 966 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — RIN α=0.20 — head_hidden micro‑sweep {48,64,80} — LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II\
    \ | 558 | 94.60 |\n| 965 | 1 | PPO without Advantage Normalization (Exp. 18) | Sagan I | 557 | 85.70 |\n| 964 | 1 | Head Width Sweep on KronoNetV4 SOTA | Krono IV | 557 | 90.40 |\n| 963 | 1 | Aether IV: Causal Gradient Manipulation - Beta Value Gradient Sweep (0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 3.0) | Aether IV | 556 | 22.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 98 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-98, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**zephyr/submissions/submission_rin_default.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nCanonical PG submission under Residual Input-Norm (RIN) defaults.\nConfig (finalized by Zephyr II):\n  - α=0.20, lr=3.5e-4, clip=1.0, value_loss_coef=0.55, entropy=0.01\n  - Architecture: 4-step LN-ConvLSTM(64) + Attn⊕GAP, head_hidden=64\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\nfrom submissions.submission_residual_inputln\
    \ import PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Fixed config via Ray Tune choices\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([3.5e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.55]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'convlstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n        'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n        'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n        'head_hidden': tune.choice([64]),\n        'steps': tune.choice([4]),\n        'alpha': tune.choice([0.20]),\n        'center_only': tune.choice([False]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN(\n        cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n        cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2']),\n        convlstm_features=int(hparams['convlstm_features']),\n        dilation=int(hparams['dilation']),\n        bottleneck_ratio=float(hparams['bottleneck_ratio']),\n\
    \        head_hidden=int(hparams['head_hidden']),\n        steps=int(hparams['steps']),\n        alpha=float(hparams['alpha']),\n        center_only=bool(hparams['center_only']),\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 3.5e-4):\n    # Final default: global clip=1.0\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate))\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
