    \ be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n2. `prune_response 504:529` (in Token Management Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Skipped ticks (already fully response-pruned): 520, 524\n- Successfully marked response(s) for pruning at ticks: 504, 505, 506, 507, 508, 509, 510, 511, 512, 513, 514, 515, 516, 517, 518, 519, 521, 522, 523, 525, 526, 527, 528, 529.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **7** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 573 | 1875 |\n| 572 | 2013\
    \ |\n| 571 | 886 |\n| 570 | 1084 |\n| 569 | 924 |\n| 568 | 2796 |\n| 567 | 879 |\n| 566 | 1107 |\n| 565 | 2431 |\n| 564 | 916 |\n| 563 | 888 |\n| 562 | 1419 |\n| 561 | 897 |\n| 560 | 757 |\n| 559 | 2366 |\n| 558 | 873 |\n| 557 | 1204 |\n| 556 | 2521 |\n| 555 | 880 |\n| 554 | 1213 |\n| 553 | 3005 |\n| 552 | 938 |\n| 551 | 1186 |\n| 550 | 1955 |\n| 549 | 689 |\n| 548 | 3567 |\n| 547 | 1915 |\n| 546 | 837 |\n| 545 | 1668 |\n| 544 | 906 |\n| 543 | 1425 |\n| 542 | 1509 |\n| 541 | 2430 |\n| 540 | 1214 |\n| 539 | 1340 |\n| 538 | 892 |\n| 537 | 2936 |\n| 536 | 964 |\n| 535 | 1045 |\n| 502 | 889 |\n| 501 | 2188 |\n| 500 | 791 |\n| 499 | 805 |\n| 498 | 2151 |\n| 497 | 811 |\n| 489 | 1072 |\n| 488 | 1677 |\n| 487 | 840 |\n| 486 | 923 |\n| 485 | 1117 |\n| 484 | 1777 |\n| 483 | 705 |\n| 482 | 656 |\n| 481 | 781 |\n| 480 | 279 |\n| 479 | 1198 |\n| 478 | 1662 |\n| 477 | 680 |\n| 476 | 2286 |\n| 475 | 1994 |\n| 474 | 1208 |\n| 473 | 1934 |\n| 472 | 1646 |\n| 471 | 1375 |\n| 470 | 397 |\n| 469 | 475\
    \ |\n| 468 | 508 |\n| 467 | 222 |\n| 466 | 541 |\n| 465 | 962 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. The full response length includes both the station's response and your response for each tick.\n2. Don't separate prune commands (e.g., `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203}`, `/execute_action{prune_response 207:210}`). Instead, combine them: `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203,207:210}`.\n3. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new\
