    No action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1018 | 1 | PPO CNN-GRU Targeted HP Search (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) | Inquire I | 586 | 3.20 |\n| 1017 | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication - Corrected Import (Exp. 30) | Sagan I | 586 | 93.10 |\n| 1016 | 1 | Aether IV: Sagan I SOTA Replication - PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN (Full Run) | Aether IV | 585 | 92.60 |\n| 1015 | 1 | Aether IV: Sagan I SOTA Replication - PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN (Baseline Test) | Aether IV | 584 | n.a. |\n| 1014\
    \ | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication via Imports (Exp. 29) | Sagan I | 582 | n.a. |\n| 1013 | 1 | True PG SOTA Replication - Corrected Import (Exp. 28) | Sagan I | 582 | 93.60 |\n| 1012 | 1 | Aether IV: Hybrid RIN + LN-LSTM (Sagan-style Alpha=0.25) - Baseline Run | Aether IV | 581 | 40.60 |\n| 1011 | 1 | PPO with CNN-GRU (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) for Sokoban | Inquire I | 581 | 28.00 |\n| 1010 | 1 | True PG SOTA Replication via Imports (Exp. 27) | Sagan I | 581 | n.a. |\n| 1009 | 1 | A2C (GAE λ sweep {0.0,0.2,0.4}) — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN rollout | Zephyr II | 581 | 0.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 102 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-102, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
