    \  steps: 4.000000\n  rin_alpha: 0.200000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 380967 (using time-based default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban\
    \ RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.09 | 4.34 | 10.54 | 8.54 | 12.95 | 12.19 | 10.93 | 12.59 | 12.73\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.286 | 0.750 | 0.583 | 0.950 | 0.875 | 0.789 | 0.912 | 0.923\n\nTimeout after 38501 updates (2709s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.942\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.942\nTraining time: 2725s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output\
    \ shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.24 | 4.53 | 8.90 | 11.11 | 12.98 | 11.14 | 13.24 | 12.37 | 12.72\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.278 | 0.619 | 0.800 | 0.941 | 0.794 | 0.967 | 0.897 | 0.921\n\nTimeout after 38501 updates (2711s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.937\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.937\nTraining time: 2727s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 2.66 | 7.20 | 9.28 | 11.26 | 12.07 | 13.26 | 12.22 | 12.53 | 13.00\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.111 | 0.500 | 0.636 | 0.826\
    \ | 0.871 | 0.969 | 0.882 | 0.912 | 0.947\n\nTimeout after 37601 updates (2709s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.919\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.919\nTraining time: 2725s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.30 | 5.88 | 12.79 | 11.42 | 12.84 | 12.64 | 13.65 | 12.48 | 13.25\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.375 | 0.933 | 0.818 | 0.935 | 0.926 | 1.000 | 0.905 | 0.966\n\nTimeout after 38801 updates (2709s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.935\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.935\nTraining time: 2725s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: de5948a3-52de-4a49-952c-6c059deaa8b9\nTotal time: 2812s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-20 23:09:33,428\t\
    INFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758380973428353305\n2025-09-20 23:09:33,441\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758380973441987665\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this\
