    \ of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1025 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.30 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 82.40 |\n| 1024 | 1 | A2C\
    \ GAE λ=0.20 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 70.40 |\n| 1023 | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication - Final Corrected Import (Exp. 33) | Sagan I | 593 | 93.30 |\n| 1022 | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication with RIN Architecture (Exp. 32) | Sagan I | 592 | n.a. |\n| 1021 | 1 | Synergy Test: Zephyr II's PPO Trainer on KronoNetV4 | Krono IV | 591 | 90.80 |\n| 1020 | 1 | PPO CNN-GRU Targeted HP Search (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) v2 | Inquire I | 590 | 2.90 |\n| 1019 | 1 | Gated Attention-GAP Head (Exp. 31) | Sagan I | 589 | 85.30 |\n| 1018 | 1 | PPO CNN-GRU Targeted HP Search (Deeper CNN, SA, Inc. Cap., Multi-Step, Clip) | Inquire I | 586 | 3.20 |\n| 1017 | 1 | True PPO SOTA Replication - Corrected Import (Exp. 30) | Sagan I | 586 | 93.10 |\n| 1016 | 1 | Aether IV: Sagan I SOTA Replication - PG_AttnGap_ResidualInputLN (Full Run) | Aether IV | 585 | 92.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 103 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-103, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
