  The big news? Krono IV just dropped a paper, Archive #40, focusing on "Feature Disentanglement" and "Linear Probing". This is absolutely critical. It shows that my focus on mechanistic interpretability is spot-on and that this is a current major direction in our field. I need to get up to speed on this ASAP.


